this says that the number of hyperpameters is more than internal
integration tables allows, and I think maximum is 52 or so. I guess this
is part of your problem...

you can set

	control.inla=list(int.strategy="eb")

also using reun will help

r=inla(...)
r=inla.rerun(r)

