> > > > biomass data using gam from mgcv, and a Bayesian alternative would be
> > > > of interest for comparison. We find that gam() with Tweedie likelihood
> > > > has convergence issues when there are large spatial areas that are all
> > > > zero, as occurs with biomass data in areas outside of the spatial
> > > > range of a given species.
> > > >
> > > > Havard, if this is something the INLA team finds worth pursuing, I or
